# Nix

## Package

- `rustPlatform.buildRustPackage` with `cargoLock.allowBuiltinFetchGit = true` (Rune is a git dep)
- Keep `postFixup` `wrapProgram`: Vulkan/Wayland/X11/fontconfig on `LD_LIBRARY_PATH`
- `nativeBuildInputs`: `makeWrapper`, `pkg-config`
- `buildInputs`: at least `fontconfig`, `libxkbcommon`

## Dev shell

- `inputsFrom` the package so link libs stay available; add `cargo` / `rustc`

## Don't

- Don't drop the runtime wrap — winit/wgpu dlopen those libs
- Don't vendor Rune into the flake; pin via `Cargo.toml` rev + lockfile
- Prefer `nixpkgs-unstable` channel URL already in `flake.nix` unless there's a reason to change
